Data Vault layer hubs, links, satellites. Hubs (business keys), links (relationships), satellites (historized attributes with hash_diff + load_date)

Create Data Vault hub models
bash

cd /home/data-modeling-playbook-dbt/dbt_project/models/data_vault

cat > hub_customer.sql << 'EOF'
-- Data Vault: Hub -- unique list of business keys only. No descriptive
-- attributes here, ever -- those belong in a satellite.
select distinct
    {{ dbt_utils.generate_surrogate_key(['customer_id']) }} as customer_hk,
    customer_id as customer_bk,
    current_timestamp as load_date,
    'orders_system' as record_source
from {{ ref('stg_customers') }}
EOF

